-- check/bad: §10.8, trigger (2) of A.5. `a` is a type variable of the
-- annotation and there is no `where` clause at all, so `a.decode s` is a
-- dispatch on the type with nothing to resolve it — and the message names
-- the constraint to add. Without this trigger the code had no reachable
-- path: lowering's `unbound_variable` would have swallowed it.
pub decode : String -> Result String a
decode s =
    a.decode s
